    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift.Wav II</strong> is a solo developed synth-wave drifting game that does not attempt to emulate actual drifting mechanics like you might see in popular simulator games. But more serve as a fun game to relax, slide &amp; jump around in single-player &amp; work your way to the top of DW's many leader-boards. If that does not interest you, drift around in multiplayer with plenty of map &amp; game-mode options and hundreds of vehicles to choose from and customize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/8a9fe30b840278ce13fe85fd680d9325.avif?t=1752189904\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/88d73ce9e962900aaf62432acb64dc34.poster.avif?t=1752189904\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/88d73ce9e962900aaf62432acb64dc34.webm?t=1752189904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/88d73ce9e962900aaf62432acb64dc34.mp4?t=1752189904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enough vehicles to last a lifetime!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 200 vehicles ranging from drift &amp; super cars to a city buses and even fictional cars. Prepare to drift cars you never knew you could drift! Just make sure to tune it up before hitting the track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/cb67100439fb095e22cbc9e5a5b8d598.avif?t=1752189904\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/d10195910a7ba620fed971c406dc29bf.poster.avif?t=1752189904\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/d10195910a7ba620fed971c406dc29bf.webm?t=1752189904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/d10195910a7ba620fed971c406dc29bf.mp4?t=1752189904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple ways to have fun &amp; drift around!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With plenty of game-modes to choose from - each having it's own leader-board with its own way to get to the top. Try out our classic endless highway or the new warp-speed game-mode that can take you above the speed of sound, there truly is plenty of ways to have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/ce9febd4adca325a93212f9dde7cad3b.avif?t=1752189904\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/32990caedc97d01e128c170d1528999b.poster.avif?t=1752189904\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/32990caedc97d01e128c170d1528999b.webm?t=1752189904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/32990caedc97d01e128c170d1528999b.mp4?t=1752189904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Multiplayer that is made for a good time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift, jump and glide around with friends in free-roam or in one of our many game-modes. All with real-time multiplayer so you can pull off some cool stunts or some tandems with your friends or even make some new friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/25a5dbf7df3b3091d93eba5f504d5052.avif?t=1752189904\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to change up your vehicle?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune it up to your exact liking with tune options for every aspect of the vehicle handling. Change up some looks &amp; custom place a spoiler and other parts of your choosing as well as custom paint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't like to looks?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize not only car parts and colors, But your environment and UI with a wide range of settings for your sky-box, fog, user interface and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/5689da84dcfe5eb7341d91fe7e5709e3.avif?t=1752189904\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complete overhaul of the previous game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a new render-pipeline, DW II delivers high quality graphics with tons of work into optimizing to ensure it runs on all computers. With plenty of in-game settings and features to customize the look &amp; feel of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift.Wav II</strong> is a solo developed synth-wave drifting game that does not attempt to emulate actual drifting mechanics like you might see in popular simulator games. But more serve as a fun game to relax, slide &amp; jump around in single-player &amp; work your way to the top of DW's many leader-boards. If that does not interest you, drift around in multiplayer with plenty of map &amp; game-mode options and hundreds of vehicles to choose from and customize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/8a9fe30b840278ce13fe85fd680d9325.avif?t=1752189904\" data-has-big width=800 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/88d73ce9e962900aaf62432acb64dc34.poster.avif?t=1752189904\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/88d73ce9e962900aaf62432acb64dc34.webm?t=1752189904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753100/extras/88d73ce9e962900aaf62432acb64dc34.mp4?t=1752189904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enough vehicles to last a lifetime!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 200 vehicles ranging from drift &amp; super cars to a city buses and even fictional cars. Prepare to drift cars you never knew you could drift! Just make sure to tune it up before hitting the track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/